  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "32df2d99-f78c-47a5-a893-2f5a53be3be3",
    "name": "RIntellix - ms-risk-engine",
    "description": "Colección de pruebas para el microservicio de motor de riesgo (ms-risk-engine).\n\nIncluye:\n- Cálculo de borradores de simulación (Simulation Draft)\n- Pruebas con tipos de solicitud PRESTAMO y TARJETA_CREDITO\n- Validación de campos obligatorios y formatos\n\nEste microservicio se comunica internamente con ms-model y ms-core-data vía Kafka y REST.\nSu único endpoint REST expuesto es POST /api/v1/simulations/draft.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json",
    "_exporter_id": "43052871"
  },
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Autenticación",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "✅ Obtener Token Analista",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Status code is 200', function () {",
                  "    pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
                  "});",
                  "pm.test('Token guardado', function () {",
                  "    var jsonData = pm.response.json();",
                  "    pm.environment.set('ACCESS_TOKEN', jsonData.access_token);",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "auth": {
              "type": "noauth"
            },
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/x-www-form-urlencoded"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "urlencoded",
              "urlencoded": [
                {
                  "key": "grant_type",
                  "value": "password"
                },
                {
                  "key": "client_id",
                  "value": "{{KEYCLOAK_CLIENT_ID}}"
                },
                {
                  "key": "username",
                  "value": "{{ANALISTA_USERNAME}}"
                },
                {
                  "key": "password",
                  "value": "{{ANALISTA_PASSWORD}}"
                }
              ]
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{KEYCLOAK_BASE_URL}}/realms/{{KEYCLOAK_REALM}}/protocol/openid-connect/token",
              "host": [
                "{{KEYCLOAK_BASE_URL}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "realms",
                "{{KEYCLOAK_REALM}}",
                "protocol",
                "openid-connect",
                "token"
              ]
            }
          },
          "response": []
        }
      ]
    },
